### Create Contact
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Aziz Karimov",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "address": "Tashkent",
  "tags": "vip,client",
  "notes": "Regular client"
}

### List Contacts
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20,
  "search": "Aziz"
}

### Get Contact Detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Contact
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Aziz Karimov Updated",
  "address": "Samarkand",
  "tags": "vip",
  "notes": "VIP Client"
}

### Delete Contact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Import Contacts CSV
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/csv
Content-Type: text/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

name,phone,address,tags,notes
Aziz Karimov,+998901234567,Toshkent,vip,Doimiy mijoz

### Add Contact to DNC
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1/dnc
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
